    not: ["gpu","gpus"],
    a: "AF-Next used around <b>108M samples from 1M hours</b> of audio, and MiDasheng trained on <b>1.1M hours</b>, both largely from public datasets. The paper shows that adding YouTube, Common Crawl and other web sources pushes this further; private foundation-model datasets of over 100M hours are not available to others.",
