    a: "Audio / text width × depth: XXS-C 256×12 / 192×12, XS-C 384×12 / 256×12, S-C 576×12 / 384×12, M-C 768×12 / 512×12 and L-C <b>896×21</b> / 640×12. Heads (audio / text) are 4/3, 6/4, 9/6, 12/8 and 14/10, and the embedding dimension equals the text width.",
